      {
        "id": "tb-tree-overview",
        "moduleId": "tree-intuition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：类文件系统的树形结构",
        "markdown": "Zookeeper 维护一个类似文件系统的数据结构（教材图 6-7）：数据按层次目录组织，形成一棵树。每个子目录项就是一个可寻址的节点，父目录与子目录之间的关系表达了数据的分组与从属。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-f0032a1ac6541cfdc41c7e48",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000186"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "（版本号：2013年 12 月 13日第一版）",
                "Zookeeper 的数据模型"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2266,
              "lineEnd": 2296,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/2e8a38ffdd1243bc6fac3c84b950213730c509dc1c64cf8e350323e09ff93fc4.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "a68b0b15b0e352be456f6fa18d9cb3dbcc9da972fbf4d2fbefd10a48178bb8ba"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-tree",
        "moduleId": "tree-intuition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：为什么协调数据采用树形组织",
        "markdown": "平铺的键值表也能存数据，但层次路径同时给出了两件事：唯一名称和分组关系。`/NameService/Server1` 既说明这个条目叫什么，也说明它属于哪个服务分组。分布式系统中的命名、配置和成员列表都需要这种“按业务分桶、桶内名称不重复”的结构，所以树形组织成为后续各类应用场景的共同基础。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-tree-overview"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-znode-definition",
        "moduleId": "znode-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：什么是 znode",
        "markdown": "树中每个子目录项，例如 `NameService`，都称为一个 **znode**。和文件系统一样，我们可以自由地增加、删除 znode，也可以在一个 znode 下增加、删除子 znode。唯一的不同在于：**znode 是可以存储数据的**。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-f0032a1ac6541cfdc41c7e48",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000186"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "（版本号：2013年 12 月 13日第一版）",
                "Zookeeper 的数据模型"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2266,
              "lineEnd": 2296,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/2e8a38ffdd1243bc6fac3c84b950213730c509dc1c64cf8e350323e09ff93fc4.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "a68b0b15b0e352be456f6fa18d9cb3dbcc9da972fbf4d2fbefd10a48178bb8ba"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-znode-vs-file",
        "moduleId": "znode-basics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "补充：znode 与文件、目录的对比",
        "markdown": "可以把 znode 看成“目录 + 数据槽”的合体：它像目录一样能挂子节点，又像文件一样能保存一段数据。判断一个概念是不是 znode，看两点即可——它有唯一路径，并且可以携带数据。只在本地内存或配置文件中出现的条目，即使也叫“节点”，并不属于这棵树。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-znode-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-path-and-children",
        "moduleId": "znode-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：路径标识与子节点约束",
        "markdown": "znode 由它所在的路径唯一标识，例如 `Server1` 这个 znode 的标识是 `/NameService/Server1`。znode 可以有子节点目录，并且每个 znode 都可以存储数据；但 **EPHEMERAL 类型的目录节点不能有子节点目录**。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
